direction: right
source: "RC source domain\nOPEN / FROZEN / CLOSING / DETACHED"
registration: "Exclusive private block\nchecked extent / fully initialized header\nfirst registration binds immutable domain"
writers: "Owner writes / valid native references\nsame source mutex\nreadonly stable-cell borrow"
collector: "Existing cooperative GC\nfreeze before old barrier\nscan every active source once\nrewrite borrowed cells then reopen"
close: "Old-roster close before member publication\nScheme payload / borrow -> refuse and rollback\nNo callback wait while gated"
native: "Byte-only detached domain\nno retained PS/VM pointer\nfinal valid reference frees node/domain"
verification: "SysML -> ASCENT\nreuse existing QNT protocol / Lean frame laws\nsource refinement + native stateful properties\nno second formal state machine"
open: "Separate successors\nraw CFFI acquisition / marker construction\nunknown join / worker failure\nindependent workers / capacity / cross-VM teardown"
registration -> source
writers -> source
source <-> collector: "Gate and existing barriers"
source -> close
close -> source: "Refused: ownership retained"
close -> native: "Accepted: bytes remain owned"
verification -> source
verification -> open: "Unresolved stays explicit"
